A '''skirmish''' occurred on the planet of [[Sorgan]] in [[9 ABY]],<ref name="Date" /> after a [[Unidentified village (Sorgan)|village]] hired [[Din Djarin]] and [[Carasynthia Dune]] to protect them from [[Klatooinian raiders]] that had been attacking and raiding the village. The Mandalorian and Dune taught the villagers some basic fighting and shooting techniques, then arranged for them to build defenses around the village so the Klatooinian tribe's [[AT-ST Raider]] and tribe were forced to approach from a single entrance. The village then dug holes in front of the entrance so the AT-ST Raider would fall into it after stepping forward. The plan worked and ended with the AT-ST Raider destroyed and the Klatooinian tribe repelled.<ref name="Chapter 4" />

